@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 getFileInfo reports a file as ignored when ignorePath is a URL, a file URL string or an absolute path, alone or in an array (tests/integration/__tests__/file-info.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Patterns in an ignore file given as a URL match relative to that file's folder, with resolveConfig on and off (tests/integration/__tests__/file-info.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Read an ignore file given as a URL or a file URL string (src/utils/read-file.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Resolve the ignored path against the folder of an ignore file given in any form (src/utils/ignore.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Types, API docs and changelog (src/index.d.ts, src/common/get-file-info.js, docs/api.md, changelog_unreleased/api/15332.md)
